  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> cannot liberate <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> from KBr, since <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is weaker oxidant than <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> , being stronger oxidants than <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> , can liberate <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> from KBr.<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />Reaction of conc. <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> with KBr forms HBr. HBr is a strong reducing agent so it reduces <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> to form a mixture of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> .<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />HBr so formed reduces <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> .<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
